        "Id": "74a4de40-a1b7-4089-800f-b5052f52d78a",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "imsom Shaboingry: The Miami Danger Lap",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111753520586",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9541cebe-902e-4141-9fa9-212eeb0864f5).Image",
        "Description": "47, a new contract for you. We are on a strict deadline, Vicky Erickson and Alyson Derby are working for the same syndicate, and are both unknowningly at the same place. The Syndicate members are anonymous even to each other. Yet they&apos;re plotting a catastrophe that&apos;d cause dozens of lives lost during the race today. You must kill them as fast as possible, and not leave a trace on the fact you were here in the first place. Consider it like a lap in the race, because you&apos;re on the clock.",
